      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MORNING DAWN (1) boxed on well to finish second last time, beaten a nose (22.46) behind Kraken Western at this track. Didn't win last time but still ran one of the quickest times on the card. Top chance in this line up. MONARCH (8) scored well last start as odds-on favourite by 4.5 lengths at this track in a handy 22.67 beating GRUMPY LION. Outside box to overcome but likes the trip. Makes plenty of appeal on the back of that last-start win. ASTON SATURN (2) was midfield throughout and finished there last time when 4th (23.00) at Geelong. Has never missed the frame from three starts from this draw, including a win. Has the ability to give this a shake. HEAVEN ON EARTH (7) scored last time and can measure up again.",
